  ]},
  {"clause_id": "c057", "issues": [
    {"issue": "\"This Declaration creates a trust and not a partnership\" cannot be squared with the First Amendment, which deleted this section and substituted a Federal Tax Status provision classifying each Series as a partnership, nor with Recital (c), Section 4.4 and the Confidential Memoranda, which treat the Trust as a partnership for tax purposes. A court would have to decide the character of the arrangement and the effect of the deletion.", "type": 2, "prob": 0.38}
